  "content": "\n\n<p>JEI/EMI 考古擴充模組</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組新增了嗅探犬（Sniffer）能挖掘出的物品列表，以及可在可疑沙土與礫石中找到的物品列表。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8drp9J9NKE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 連結</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/260/2023-07-20-21_05_26-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"891\" height=\"838\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/261/2023-07-20-21_06_02-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"886\" height=\"836\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252flobstermods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jonn.dk/akliz_banner_archaeology.png\" alt=\"贊助時間\" width=\"830\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
